BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Inner Peace Collective
UID:event_ghjcztyjckbgb@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260628T043148Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260704T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260704T160000
SUMMARY:Sonic Journey Through Sound
DESCRIPTION:Inner Peace Collective\n**Start Your Work Week with a Sound Me
 ditation:**\n[Every Weekend @ 11am & 3pm](https://somaticsounds.net/events
 /)\n**\\* $26 to reserve please use the event link** [https://somaticsound
 s.net/events/](https://somaticsounds.net/events/)\n\nSonic Journey Through
  Sound\nCome experience a somatic journey where ancient wisdom meets moder
 n well-being — a multidimensional soundscape\, richer and more textured 
 than a traditional sound bath. Vivek guides each session with over 40 hand
 crafted singing bowls\, layered with binaural beats to support deep relaxa
 tion and nervous system regulation. Participants leave feeling settled in 
 the body and quiet in the mind.\n\nYoga mats\, pillows\, and blankets are 
 provided.\n\nThis event is open to all levels—whether you’re a seasone
 d mindfulness enthusiast\, exploring a novel path to relaxation\, or simpl
 y seeking stress relief.\n\n\\*\\* $26 to Reserve a spot please use Event 
 Link or Contact Vivek\n**[Every Weekend @ 11am & 3pm](https://somaticsound
 s.net/events/)**\n\n#soundhealing #soundbath #meditation
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/inner-peace-collective/events/ghjczty
 jckbgb/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260626T223419Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260626T223419Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Inner Peace Collective
UID:event_thjcztyjckbhb@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260628T043148Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260705T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260705T190000
SUMMARY:Sunday Sound Meditation with Himalayan Bowls
DESCRIPTION:Inner Peace Collective\n**Start Your Work Week with a Sound Me
 ditation:**\n[Every Weekend @ 11am & 6pm](https://somaticsounds.net/events
 /)\n**\\* $26 to reserve please use the event link** [https://somaticsound
 s.net/events/](https://somaticsounds.net/events/)\n\nStep into a somatic j
 ourney of sound and relaxation\, where ancient wisdom meets modern well-be
 ing. Let the soothing tones of Himalayan singing bowls wash over you\, cal
 ming your mind and rejuvenating your spirit.\n\nGuided by Vivek from Ashev
 ille\, this immersive sound meditation features over 40 handcrafted singin
 g bowls\, each producing a rich spectrum of intricate\, highly somatic fre
 quencies and overtones. More than just a sound bath\, these harmonious and
  grounding tones can profoundly influence your physical\, emotional\, ment
 al\, and spiritual states\, helping you reset and start your week with cla
 rity and balance.\n\nThis event is open to all levels—whether you’re a
  seasoned mindfulness enthusiast\, exploring a novel path to relaxation\, 
 or simply seeking stress relief.\n\n\\*\\* $26 to Reserve a spot please us
 e Event Link or Contact Vivek\n**[Every Weekend @ 11am & 6pm](https://soma
 ticsounds.net/events/)**\nOr\n**[Contact Vivek](https://somaticsounds.net/
 contact/)**\n\n#soundhealing #soundbath #meditation
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/inner-peace-collective/events/thjczty
 jckbhb/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260626T223732Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260626T223732Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
